[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最終確認をしよう\r\n今日の出番は、ラジオの中のコーナーで",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00009",
    "bgm": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "アンティーカの宣伝、バッチリ決めてくるんでしょ？\r\n任せて任せて",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……それにしてもさぁ、こんな風にラジオに出れちゃうとか\r\nなんかほんとにアイドルみたいだよねー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今さら何を言ってるんだ\r\nみたい、じゃなくてアイドルだろう",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いやいや、三峰まだドッキリ説捨ててないから\r\nいつネタばらしされてもいいように心の準備もしてるから",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当にドッキリだったら俺が１番ビックリするなぁ\r\nスカウトした理由もなくなるし",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……今日はひとりでの仕事だけど、いけそうか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いつもみんなと一緒だからって心配しすぎだよ、\r\nプロデューサー",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "それじゃ三峰がひとりだとダメな子みたいじゃ……\r\nって、バレてたか～！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その調子なら、緊張もしてなさそうだな\r\n本番もそのまま──",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "それよりプロデューサー聞いて聞いて！\r\nさっき廊下に三峰が追ってるアイドルがいたんだよ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "すごいなぁ……！　スタジオ隣だったりしないかなぁ……！\r\n何かのラッキーで挨拶できちゃったりとか……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ぶれないな……",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……落ち着いていて良かったと思ったけど、\r\nまだお客さん意識の方が強いのかもしれない……）",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もうすぐ自分の仕事が控えてるんだ\r\nそろそろ集中しよう",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あれー？　乗ってくれない……ほんとに心配性だなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おっけおっけ、わかってますよ。切り替え大事！\r\n……はい、今お仕事モード入りました！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……本当にわかってるんだよな？\r\n新人ではあるけど、結華はもうれっきとした──",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "三峰結華さん。そろそろ、スタンバイお願いしまーす",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あらら、三峰呼ばれてる\r\nありがたいお説教聞けなくて残念だなぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "先行くね、Ｐたん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ、おい……",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "x": 200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫か……？\r\n──って、俺もスタジオ行かないと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 240
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 240
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふう、終わった終わった。プロデューサーもお疲れー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00009",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 700
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰の初ラジオ、どうだった？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020130"
  },
  {
    "select": "楽しそうな\r\nラジオだったよ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "安心して聞けたよ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "抱腹絶倒した",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "変に心配して悪かった\r\n会話も弾んでたし、結華も手ごたえあったんじゃないか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "どうしたのプロデューサー、絶賛してくれるじゃん！\r\n待って待って。褒めても何も出ませんよー？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、本当に。初めてとは思えなかったよ\r\n緊張もしてなさそうだったし",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "緊張より、夢中になってる間に終わっちゃったって感じかな\r\n楽しかったけど、もっと話せた気もするんだよねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "パーソナリティさんが振ってくれたことに答えるだけ、\r\nみたいになっちゃったし、次はもっと上手くやるよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど。結華としては反省点もあるわけか",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでも、初めてであれだけスムーズに喋れたことは\r\n誇っていいと思うぞ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おお……ここまで好感触とは……！\r\n三峰、このままラジドル路線に行っちゃうのもアリか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この調子なら、\r\n本当にラジドル路線もいいかもしれない）",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おっ、安定感のある三峰のトークに\r\nプロデューサーも高評価くれちゃう感じです？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな。……まぁ、話も聞かずに出て行った時は\r\nどうなることかと思ったけど",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s2",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "始まってみれば、しっかり受け答えもできてたし\r\n心配する必要なかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そこはほら、お仕事モード入ったって言ったでしょ\r\n三峰、こう見えて切り替えは早い方なんだよね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、本当に驚かされた。さすがは結華だ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いやー、そうでしょうそうでしょう！\r\n三峰、自分の才能が怖いなぁ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……とまぁここまで言うのは冗談としても、\r\nこういうお仕事、三峰としては割と向いてると思うんだよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だからさ、もっといっぱい取ってこれたりしないかな？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あ！　それかいっそ、プロデューサーと三峰で\r\nネットラジオとか始めちゃってもいいよ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、俺が出てどうするんだ……",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、アンティーカでやるのは面白そうだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "お、プロデューサーも乗り気だねー？\r\n三峰、期待して待ってるよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020250,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "え、そこまで？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、結華の返しが面白くて、ずっと笑ってたよ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "んー……？　そんなに面白いとこあったかな……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020270,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……はっ！　三峰、わかっちゃったかも！\r\nこれはプロデューサーなりの気遣いなんだね！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないさ、本当に良かったよ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020280,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "オーバーに言ってない？\r\n甘やかすのはよくないと思うけどー？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺じゃなくて、今度は結華が心配性だな",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020290,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……なるほど。そこまで言ってもらえるなら、\r\n今回はそういうことにしといちゃおっかな！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001020300,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "せっかく褒めてもらえたんだしね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700102/1007001020300"
  },
  {
